  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In-donor refugee costs 2022 (other temporary sustenance)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">V&#xfd;davky na ute&#x10d;encov v krajine donora 2022 (in&#xe1; do&#x10d;asn&#xe1; ob&#x17e;iva)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Celkov&#xe9; n&#xe1;klady na prepravu ute&#x10d;encov v krajine donora v roku 2022 (mzdy zamestnancov M&#xda; SR a administrat&#xed;vne n&#xe1;klady), sektor In&#xe1; do&#x10d;asn&#xe1; ob&#x17e;iva (93014). Kalkul&#xe1;cia v&#xa0;s&#xfa;lade s metodol&#xf3;giou vykazovania rozvojovej pomoci pre v&#xfd;davky na ute&#x10d;encov v krajine donora, ber&#xfa;cej do &#xfa;vahy pravidl&#xe1; vykazovania, ktor&#xfd;ch aplik&#xe1;ciu OECD od SR po&#x17e;aduje.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Total in-donor regugee costs (remuneration for contractual MO staff, translation and interpretention,&#xa0;salaries of full-time employees) for asylum seekers&#xa0;in the donor country of 2022 - with purpose code Other temporary sustenance (93014). Calculation in accordance with the Development Assistance Reporting Methodology for Refugee Expenditure in the Donor Country, taking into account the reporting rules that the OECD requires from the Slovak Republic.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
